  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/293/morning-glory-header.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/697/cat-good-morning.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>說明</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">改善你的貓咪早晨禮物</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">支援伺服器端。你可以在伺服器上安裝此模組，客戶端無需安裝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">由製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同位作者製作（想體驗完整的 RPG 內容，請取得 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 模組包</a>，享受任務與 RPG 玩法）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>特色</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">（這些功能將進一步提升你的原版體驗）&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">在原版 Minecraft 中，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fCat_gift_farming\" rel=\"nofollow\">早晨禮物</a>給予玩家的物品有限，且幽靈膜非常罕見。此模組將玩家貓咪每天早晨給予的戰利品改為更豐富的戰利品列表。以下是你可以從貓咪早晨禮物中獲得的新物品列表。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>常見</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 兔皮</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 兔腳</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 生雞肉</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 羽毛</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 腐肉</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 線</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 幽靈膜</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 西瓜片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e67e23;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>稍微稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 鑽石</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 金蘋果</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 金胡蘿蔔</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 不死圖騰</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 紫水晶碎片</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 海洋之心</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 凋零骷髏頭顱</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 回聲碎片</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 海綿</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 試煉鑰匙（1.21+）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>極度稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 終界水晶</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 鸚鵡螺殼</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 地獄之星</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 不祥之瓶（1.21+）&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即取得伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
